    {"dot":"cyan","title":"B07a scope (guardrails)","items":["Part of B07-guardrails-ops split (103 routes/22 controllers reconciled; throttle/platform-knobs excluded as 0-route modules). Guardrail modules: availability (4/1), evaluation-internal (1/1), notice (6/2), policy (17/2), tenant-policy (3/2) = 31 routes / 8 controllers.","Admin surfaces: guardrail availability, policy, metrics, tenant policy, rule test. Consultation-facing: guardrail notices. Admin evaluation reads: /admin/consultations guardrail evaluations.","Internal evaluation ingest is service-to-service (guardrail service token/internal tenant lock patterns evidenced)."]},
    {"dot":"violet","title":"Example input/output (representative)","items":["Guardrail policy/availability/tenant policy: admin CRUD/config requests -> policy/availability/config responses. Rule test requests evaluate sample inputs against rules -> test/evaluation result.","Guardrail notices: consultation notice list/read/ack flows -> notice/hold state for consultation UI/workflows. Verify notice payloads and PHI-safety semantics.","Internal evaluation ingest: POST /internal/guardrail/evaluations with service token + tenant context -> persisted evaluation/ingest result. Verify DTO, idempotency, and auth requirements."]},
    {"dot":"emerald","title":"Evidence, security, limitations","items":["Repo https://github.com/ArcaAI/project-hope.git @ 8cb2e5e8e6bbddf5ee7c676782ebb5ad683c23a0. Controller/service sources verified in local tree.","Security/internal: guardrail evaluation internal controller is @Public/@ApiExcludeController with InternalServiceTokenGuard + InternalTenantLockGuard (service=guardrail token model per controller comments).","Limitations: grouped endpoint nodes (31 routes/8 controllers); reconcile exact route/DTO contracts, notice/evaluation schemas, and hold/reconciliation behavior with OpenAPI/implementation."]}
